   "calculations.remittance_waterfall",
   "entities.District.fields.collected_to_date_cents",
   "entities.AssessmentPeriod.fields.collected_total_cents"
  ],
  "distinguishing_aspect": "One payment touches four rows \u2014 Remittance, AssessmentStatement, AssessmentPeriod and\nDistrict \u2014 and all four are settled before the 201 returns. The waterfall split is recorded\non the Remittance row in the response, the statement is already PAID_IN_FULL, and the\ndistrict and period money counters have already moved by the full amount_cents, so the\npublic financial summary read that follows needs no delay and no re-read to agree.\n",
